  "extraEvidence": "Distant Horizons 3.3.2 (Elias, 3 October 2026; docs/design/mod-pingpong.md#distant-horizons-310): names and types read from the pinned JAR (Config.java fields, assets/distanthorizons/lang/en_us.json), _version 4 from ConfigFileHandler.loadFromFile. Quality and CPU presets live only in its GUI, so the file carries what MEDIUM (RenderQualityPresetConfigEventHandler) and LOW_IMPACT (3 threads at ratio 1.0 on a 12-thread CPU) set, with SSAO off; the GUI then reads Custom. ignoredDimensionCsv lists every dimension the pinned JARs and the companion register except the Overworld (tools/test_generate_client_defaults.py checks it); ae2:spatial_storage is registered in code. Ars Nouveau planarium dimensions get random names and cannot be listed."
